      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1996 the city designated the Capitol Hill Urban Design District to preserve historic architecture while encouraging new development.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capitol_Hill%2C_Oklahoma_City",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Capitol Hill became an official Main Street community in 1997, sparking a revival that restored its historic business and entertainment character.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capitol_Hill%2C_Oklahoma_City",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The area is now a hub for Hispanic culture, featuring venues like the Knob Hill Theater and the indie rock spot Resonant Head.",
